["Add XML sitemap and robots.txt","A sitemap provides a structured list of important URLs. Robots.txt can communicate crawler access rules. These files should reflect the actual site architecture and should not block important content accidentally."],
["Improve Core Web Vitals and mobile usability","Measure real performance and address the largest bottlenecks first. Efficient images, sensible JavaScript, stable layouts and responsive design can improve both user experience and technical quality."],
