["Select a migration strategy","Options can include rehosting, replatforming, refactoring or replacing a component. The appropriate approach depends on business risk, technical condition, time and budget."],
["Plan security and access controls","Cloud systems should use least-privilege access, secure secrets management, appropriate network controls, backups and monitoring. Security architecture should be part of the migration plan."],
